# Scientific / physics / engineering vocabulary for vim spell (en_us).
# Declaratively managed from ~/.nix/modules/_assets/dotfiles/nvim/spell/.
# Sources: harvest-spellbad over ~/Documents/me/vault (2026-08-16) + curated.
# Format: one word per line; leading `_` marks a compound fragment; `#` is a
# comment (also used by `zw` to mark words wrong).
#   lowercase word  → matches that word, First-cap, and ALL-CAPS (als/Als/ALS)
#   ACronyms/TiTi  → keep-case: uppercase letters required at those positions
# Add words by editing this file and rebuilding (repo is the source of truth).
# List BASE forms only: plural and possessive inflections (PINNs, PDE's, ...)
# are derived at build time (modules/programs/nvim.nix). Irregular / plural-
# only words (moduli, minima, ...) are kept here as-is.

